# Backend origin for local live reviews; never put keys or tokens here.
# npm run dev: unset/blank uses http://localhost:5000.
# npm run build: unset/blank leaves only the sample available; live submission is disabled.
# For a LOCAL production preview, set http://localhost:5000 before building.
# Next.js embeds this public value at build time; rebuild/redeploy after changing it.
# Keep the UI and TrustedLocal API on the same local hostname for session cookies.
# A public Vercel frontend cannot use the loopback-only TrustedLocal API.
# The illustrative sample always works without a backend or credentials.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=
